.TH ORO-SERVICE-WORKER-CONTEXT 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:service\-worker/context \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:service\-worker/context'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
oro:service\-worker/context is a JavaScript API module exposed by the Oro Runtime.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBContext\fR
A context given to `ExtendableEvent` interfaces and provided to simplified service worker modules
.TP
\fBconstructor(event)\fR
`Context` class constructor.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIevent\fR (import('./events.js').ExtendableEvent; required)
.TP
\fBevent()\fR
The `ExtendableEvent` for this `Context` instance.
.TP
\fBenv()\fR
An environment context object.
.TP
\fBresetEnvironment()\fR
Resets the current environment context.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<boolean>\fR
.TP
\fBwaitUntil(promise)\fR
Tells the event dispatcher that work is ongoing. It can also be used to detect whether that work was successful.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIpromise\fR (Promise; required)
.TP
\fBhandled()\fR
TODO
.TP
\fBclient()\fR
Gets the client for this event context.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<import('./clients.js').Client>\fR
